    "rares_mythics_max_1_each": "PASS - Hopeful Initiate 1, Thalia, Heretic Cathar 1, Odric, Lunarch Marshal 1, Restoration Angel 1, Overgrown Farmland 1. CORRECTED after the Phase 9 approval round: the earlier attestation still listed Stitcher's Graft, which was cut, and omitted Overgrown Farmland, which is a RARE LAND and does count against the cap.",
    "rares_mythics_max_5_total_MB_plus_SB": "PASS at exactly 5/5 - Hopeful Initiate, Thalia, Odric, Restoration Angel and Overgrown Farmland, all mainboard, zero in the sideboard. This is the only one of the four decks that spends a rare slot on a LAND; the reasoning is in Overgrown Farmland's verdict.",
    "basics": "Plains x10, Forest x4 - format-supplied, exempt from copy limits. Radiant Grove x2 is a COMMON nonbasic and legal at 2.",
    "colour": "core_colors ['G','W'], splash_colors [] - every nonland card returns a non-null effective_cost.best_mode(card, ['G','W'], []) in normal cast mode. Ambitious Farmhand and Twinblade Geist are DFCs whose back faces stay inside GW."
